    "detailed_description": "Immoral Shadows gathers the best 16 fighters around, showcasing their fighting abilities in 8 different stages and across 12 different game modes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFight against other warriors in; one vs one, tag-team and survival modes. Each mode, you can fight in various battles; training, player vs CPU, player vs player and tournament battles. This variation creates a total of 12 different fight choices between all the modes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay online with friends via Remote Play Together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is meant as a fun, retro style punch 'em up fighting game. Simple moves and simple controls, but also has special moves and combo's.",
